# Composer (dev tooling only - moodle-cs for local coding-standard checks).
# The lock file is deliberately not tracked: CI installs its own moodle-cs with
# moodle-plugin-ci, so pinning ours would let the local ruleset drift behind the
# one CI actually enforces - which is the whole thing this tooling is here to
# prevent. `composer install` resolves the newest matching release instead.
/vendor/
/composer.lock
